  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal, administrative term. The subject is typically a government office or official body that accepts documents from individuals. Passive form {受理|じゅり}される is very common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {申請|しんせい}を{受理|じゅり}する: to accept an application\n- {届|とどけ}を{受理|じゅり}する: to accept a registration/notification\n- {受理|じゅり}{番号|ばんごう}: acceptance/receipt number\n- {受理|じゅり}{日|び}: date of acceptance",
